  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refined-cooking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/查看我的另一款整合精緻儲存與烹飪模組的模組-底部連結-e78a4e?labelColor=7f1620&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"精緻烹飪宣傳\" width=\"800\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Applied_Cooking/BH_AC_Header.png\" alt=\"應用烹飪標題\" width=\"1125\" height=\"378\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/適用於 Forge-1.19 | 1.18-edbd7e?labelColor=154a48&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Minecraft 版本標章\" width=\"266\" height=\"28\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/安裝於-用戶端與伺服器-edbd7e?labelColor=154a48&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"應用烹飪安裝標章\" width=\"240\" height=\"28\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmeloncube.net%252fsebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Applied_Cooking/BH_AC_Promo.png\" alt=\"應用烹飪宣傳\" width=\"1808\" height=\"268\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Applied_Cooking/BH_AC_Description.png\" alt=\"應用烹飪說明\" width=\"1808\" height=\"179\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這款模組能讓應用能源2與方塊廚師共同運作！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增了一個方塊：廚房工作站！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在將廚房工作站放置為CFB廚房網絡的一部分之前，您需要像設定無線終端一樣對其進行配置。對於Minecraft 1.20以下版本，您需要在AE2安全終端中進行設定；而對於Minecraft 1.20及以上版本，則需要在AE2無線存取點中進行設定。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">當所有設備連接完成後，您就能直接從烹飪台取用AE2網絡儲存中的物品。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Applied_Cooking/BH_AC_Recipes.png\" alt=\"應用烹飪配方\" width=\"1808\" height=\"824\"></p><h2>方塊</h2><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>&nbsp;</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>已連接</strong></span></th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>未連接</strong></span></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>廚房工作站</strong></span></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/19RvTpK/appliedcooking-kitchenstation-connected.png\" alt=\"廚房工作站已連接\" width=\"397\" height=\"376\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/brxMbvZ/appliedcooking-kitchenstation-disconnected.png\" alt=\"廚房工作站未連接\" width=\"430\" height=\"376\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Applied_Cooking/BH_AC_Screenshot.png\" alt=\"應用烹飪截圖\" width=\"1808\" height=\"824\"></p><h2>社群媒體</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/itssebastrn/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=ItsSebastrn&amp;color=edbd7e&amp;labelColor=154a48&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn的Curseforge\" width=\"148\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fItsSebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=@ItsSebastrn&amp;color=edbd7e&amp;labelColor=154a48&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn的Twitter\" width=\"159\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC46TYUp8WpcFub8NxuGA66A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Sebastrn&amp;color=edbd7e&amp;labelColor=154a48&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn的Youtube\" width=\"125\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/itssebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=ItsSebastrn&amp;color=edbd7e&amp;labelColor=154a48&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitch&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn的Twitch\" width=\"148\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Sebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Sebastrn&amp;color=edbd7e&amp;labelColor=154a48&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn的Github\" width=\"125\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refined-cooking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Applied_Cooking/BH_AC_RCLink.png\" alt=\"精緻烹飪宣傳\" width=\"1808\" height=\"268\"></a></p>",
